### 201 - Guaranteed review price updated
PATCH http://localhost:8085/api/mentor/guaranteed-review/1
X-Telegram-User-Id: 123456
X-User-Roles: MENTOR
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priceUsd": 50
}
###

### 400 - Invalid prices
PATCH http://localhost:8085/api/mentor/guaranteed-review/1111
X-Telegram-User-Id: 1234
X-User-Roles: MENTOR
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priceUsd": -3333
}
###

### 403 - Current user is not a mentor
PATCH http://localhost:8085/api/mentor/guaranteed-review/1111
X-Telegram-User-Id: 1234
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priceUsd": 15
}
###

### 404 - Guaranteed review was not found
PATCH http://localhost:8085/api/mentor/guaranteed-review/99999999
X-Telegram-User-Id: 123456
X-User-Roles: MENTOR
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priceUsd": 30
}
###
